<title>USA: NIPSCO Industries to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>NIPSCO Industries to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MERRILLVILLE, Ind. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>NIPSCO Industries Inc said Wednesday its board of directors authorized the additional repurchase of up to five million of the company's common shares.</p>
<p>The company said the timing of the share repurchase will depend on market conditions and alternative investment opportunities.</p>
<p>There are about 63.7 million shares outstanding as of March 31, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>NIPSCO's board previously authorized repurchase of up to 21 million shares and about 20.2 million shares have been repurchased as of March 27, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>NIPSCO shares rose 1/8 to 39-3/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
